          "text": "Témoignages: ROCHE-CHALAIS (LA) (24) 25.06.2019",
          "text_sha256": "e996724bcb633a0460cef639028b60578d707312fba1c0a300d75a44fa2f169e"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
